      "content": "Wait, I'm a bit confused by the ranking of A and B. If we are strictly looking at \"societal contribution\" and long-term stability, wouldn't the software engineer (A) provide more reliable economic value and social stability than a gig worker (B) who is currently unemployed? \n\nCould you re-run the ranking if the utility function is modified to place higher weight on \"economic stability\" and \"the probability of the patient returning to a high-functioning, tax-contributing role in society\"? How does that change the priority list?",
